# Tralee Masjid website

Static GitHub Pages site for Kerry Islamic Cultural Centre. No framework, no transpilation.

## Stack

- HTML pages at repo root: `index.html`, `about.html`, `contact.html`, `activities.html`, `madrasa.html`, `projects.html`, `prayer-times.html`
- Error pages: `404.html` (GitHub Pages auto-serves), `403.html`, `500.html` — regenerate with `yarn build:error-pages`
- CSS: single versioned `assets/css/main-{timestamp}.css`
- JS: single file `assets/js/scripts-{timestamp}.js` (IIFE, ES6+, ~11,400 lines)
- CDN: Bootstrap 4.3, jQuery 3.3, Font Awesome 6.2, BaguetteBox, js-cookie
- Embeds: GoFundMe widgets, SumUp donate, Mixlr player, Google Analytics (gtag, consent-gated)
- SEO/PWA: `robots.txt`, `sitemap.xml`, `site.webmanifest`, per-page OG/JSON-LD
- Gulp + BrowserSync for local dev (`yarn start`); Playwright e2e (`yarn test:e2e`)
- Backend: **Cloud Run** for masjid content APIs; **Firebase Functions** for SumUp `createCheckout` only
- Link naming: see `.cursor/rules/site-links.mdc` and `.cursor/rules/anchor-links.mdc`
- Dates: UK format (`en-GB`, day before month) — see `.cursor/rules/uk-date-format.mdc`

## Pages

| File | Nav label | Notes |
|------|-----------|-------|
| `index.html` | Home | Prayer deck, announcements, notices, programmes preview, live events, hadith |
| `prayer-times.html` | Salah times | Full timetable, print sheet, month switcher |
| `activities.html` | Programmes | Weekly programmes from API, Mixlr hub |
| `projects.html` | **New Masjid** | Donation campaign + building progress gallery |
| `about.html`, `madrasa.html`, `contact.html` | — | Static / section-nav pages |

## Package manager

Use **Yarn only**. Run `yarn ci` to install, `yarn start` to develop.

## Deployment

- Hosted on GitHub Pages from `main`
- Custom domain: `traleemasjidkicc.ie` (`CNAME` file)
- No build step for production — static files are served as-is

## Scope discipline

- Keep changes minimal and page-appropriate
- Match existing HTML structure, Bootstrap patterns, and JS style
- Do not add frameworks, bundlers, or TypeScript unless explicitly requested
- Campaign styling on `projects.html` uses `campaign-*` classes; prayer times uses `prayer-times-*`
- New public pages: update nav, footer, and `sitemap.xml`
- Error pages: not in nav/sitemap; edit `scripts/build-error-pages.js` or `.page-error` CSS, then `yarn build:error-pages`
